const formState=()=>{const o={};panel?.querySelectorAll('#vehicleExtraFilters input,#vehicleExtraFilters select').forEach(x=>o[x.name]=x.type==='checkbox'?x.checked:x.value);return o};
let brandPause=0,brandPrev=0,brandCycleWidth=0;
const normalizeBrandScroll=()=>{if(brandCycleWidth&&custom.scrollLeft>=brandCycleWidth)custom.scrollLeft-=brandCycleWidth;};
const renderBrands=()=>{if(selected==='car'){custom.hidden=true;return}custom.hidden=false;custom.innerHTML='';const trk=document.createElement('div');trk.className='vehicle-brand-track';for(const b of DATA.find(x=>x.id===selected).brands){const btn=document.createElement('button');btn.type='button';btn.className='brand-chip vehicle-brand-chip';btn.dataset.brand=b;const logo=brandLogo(b);if(logo){const img=document.createElement('img');img.src=logo;img.alt='';img.loading='lazy';img.onerror=()=>{img.remove();btn.classList.add('no-logo')};btn.append(img)}else {btn.classList.add('no-logo');const monogram=document.createElement('strong');monogram.className='vehicle-brand-monogram';monogram.textContent=b.trim().slice(0,2).toLocaleUpperCase();monogram.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');btn.append(monogram)}const sp=document.createElement('span');sp.textContent=b;btn.append(sp);trk.append(btn)}custom.append(trk);const originalWidth=trk.scrollWidth;brandCycleWidth=originalWidth;const originals=[...trk.children];originals.forEach(btn=>{const clone=btn.cloneNode(true);clone.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');clone.tabIndex=-1;trk.append(clone)});brandCycleWidth=trk.children[originals.length]?.offsetLeft-trk.children[0]?.offsetLeft||originalWidth;custom.scrollLeft=0;brandPause=performance.now()+1400};
const makeField=(name,label,type='text',options=null)=>{const wrap=document.createElement('label');wrap.className='vehicle-field';const span=document.createElement('span');span.textContent=label;wrap.append(span);let input;if(options){input=document.createElement('select');for(const [value,text] of options){const opt=document.createElement('option');opt.value=value;opt.textContent=text;input.append(opt)}}else{input=document.createElement('input');input.type=type;if(type==='number')input.min='0';input.placeholder='—'}input.name=name;wrap.append(input);return wrap};
